 // wwe2k14 patch (Session 59, vulkan_constants_reuse_identical): the buffer of `kind` written last in this frame, if it
 // holds these bytes, becomes the current one (its place; for the dynamic offsets its mapping - a repack copies from the
 // shadow copy, which holds the same bytes, or from that mapping).
